    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρεπ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causing change in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις -κὴ τῆς ὕλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					2.3.17
				</span></i>
			; epith. of the sign Libra, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
			</span></i> Astr.<i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>:—
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπτικός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				10.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, κινοῦσι τὴν γῆν οὐ μεταβατικῶς
					ἀλλὰτρεπτικῶς τροχοῦ δίκην</span>”
				<i>by revolution,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Placit.
					3.13.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
